{
  "Npcs.HarpyQueen.Desc": "You face the Harpy Queen, a broodmother of epic proportions - literally. Her hips are amazingly wide, thrice her own width at the least, and the rest of her body is lushly voluptuous, with plush, soft thighs and a tremendous butt. Her wide wings beat occasionally, sending ripples through her jiggly body. She wields a towering whitewood staff in one hand, using the other to cast eldritch spells."
  "Npcs.HarpyQueen.Name": "Harpy Queen"
}
